"to global clipboard* shortcuts to :kbd:`Win` + :kbd:`c` for copy, and :kbd:"
"`Win` + :kbd:`v` for paste:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-and-paste-text.rst:70
